{{Quote|text="My work ethic has nothing in common with my manager's. I'm not sure he even goes home... He pressures me to work overtime. I'm so tired after a shift here... but I do need the money..."}}
'''Claire''' is a [[Villagers|villager]] who lives in the countryside outside of [[Pelican Town]] and buses in to work as a cashier at [[JojaMart]]. She is one of the 7 marriage candidates added by Stardew Valley Expanded.

If the Community Center is completed and the movie theater is unlocked, Claire is employed as a cashier in the theater instead. She enjoys reading, dancing, and watching films.

== Schedule ==
Claire has a set schedule throughout the week, only appearing in Pelican Town on days she works. Since she lives in the country outside of town, she cannot be visited on her days off.

If Claire is temporarily unemployed, she will not have a reason to come into town, unless the player has seen her 6 Hearts event.

